Subject: [PATCH 2/5] patch 02: move normalizeLandline to util/LandlineNumber,
 fix the 091 prefix

Behaviour kept except one fix: a 13-digit 091-prefixed number normalized to 12 digits (917242459222) instead of 07242459222. Callers only test for null, so nothing visible changes. The stale 'same regex as v1Convert validator' comment is removed: no regex is used, and the backend copy the spec expected is not in this repo.
